<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">8.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;<U>CONTINUING
GUARANTEE</U>. Unless terminated pursuant to this <U>Section&nbsp;8</U>, this Limited Guaranty shall remain in full force and effect
